", "C", "D", "T"], "data_tckt_seq": ["N", "C", "D", "T"], "has_data": true, "vote_result": "N", "prv_code": "00", "city_code": "000", "area_code": "00", "dept_code": "000", "li_code": "0000", "print_order": null, "area_name": "全國"}, {"theme_id": "ba0c9afc8b422dbad7444b39950317a9", "case_type": "N", "data_level": "N", "case_no": 4, "topic": "你是否同意制定法律追究國家領導人及其部屬，因故意或重大過失之措施，造成國家嚴重損害之責任，並由立法院設立調查委員會調查，政府各部門應全力配合，不得抗拒，以維全民利益，並懲處違法失職人員，追償不當所得？", "vote_date": "2008-01-12", "data_prof_seq": ["N", "C", "D", "T"], "data_tckt_seq": ["N", "C", "D", "T"], "has_data": true, "vote_result": "N", "prv_code": "00", "city_code": "000", "area_code": "00", "dept_code": "000", "li_code": "0000", "print_order": null, "area_name": "全國"}, {"theme_id": "c7397c49e4e551eb48dadd987b464cb9", "case_type": "N", "data_level": "N", "case_no": 3, "topic": "你是否同意依下列原則制定「政黨不當取得財產處理條例」，將中國國民黨黨產還給全民：國民黨及其附隨組織的財產，除黨費、政治獻金及競選補助金外，均推定為不當取得的財產，應還給人民。已處分者，應償還價額。", "vote_date": "2008-01-12", "data_prof_seq": ["N", "C", "D", "T"], "data_tckt_seq": ["N", "C", "D", "T"], "has_data": true, "vote_result": "N", "prv_code": "00", "city_code": "000", "area_code": "00", "dept_code": "000", "li_code": "0000", "print_order": null, "area_name": "全國"}, {"theme_id": "875d07153f124922d50afd23c0c31c3a", "case_type": "N", "data_level": "N", "case_no": 2, "topic": "你是不是同意政府與中共展開協商談判，推動建立兩岸和平穩定的互動架構，謀求兩岸的共識與人民的福祉？", "vote_date": "2004-03-20", "data_prof_seq": ["N", "C", "D"], "data_tckt_seq": ["N", "C", "D"], "has_data": true, "vote_result": "N", "prv_code": "00", "city_code": "000", "area_code": "00", "dept_code": "000", "li_code": "0000", "print_order": null, "area_name": "全國"}, {"theme_id": "a089e9d5c0b913b871d5832fba52a1fb", "case_type": "N", "data_level": "N", "case_no": 1, "topic": "台灣人民堅持台海問題應該和平解決。如果中共不撤除瞄準台灣的飛彈、不放棄對台灣使用武力，你是不是同意政府增加購置反飛彈裝備，強化台灣自我防衛能力？", "vote_date": "2004-03-20", "data_prof_seq": ["N", "C", "D"], "data_tckt_seq": ["N", "C", "D"], "has_data": true, "vote_result": "N", "prv_code": "00", "city_code": "00